# Build-context exclusions for caddy.Dockerfile (OPS-DEPLOY FR-DEPLOY-2). BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore
# next to the Dockerfile. A second guard beside the COPY allow-list: host dependencies, build outputs and any .env
# never enter the build.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/storybook-static
**/__pycache__
**/.env*
